    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie\n\n7 Glencove, is an impressive three-bedroom mid-terrace residence set within an exclusive gated development, just a short stroll from the picturesque seaside village of Courtown Harbour.\n\nPresented in superb, turnkey condition, this beautifully maintained home offers the perfect blend of comfort, style, and convenience. Whether you are searching for a permanent family residence, a holiday retreat, or a coastal investment, 7 Glencove is sure to impress.\n\nThe well-designed accommodation comprises a bright and spacious kitchen/dining room and a welcoming living room on the ground floor, creating an ideal space for both everyday living and entertaining. Upstairs, there are three generously proportioned bedrooms, including a spacious principal bedroom with ensuite, together with a stylish family bathroom. The property also benefits from the addition of solar panels, providing improved energy efficiency and reduced running costs.\n\nCourtown Harbour is one of Ireland's most popular seaside destinations, offering an outstanding lifestyle with an abundance of amenities and recreational activities right on your doorstep. Enjoy beautiful sandy beaches, scenic forest walks, championship golf courses, and internationally acclaimed spas. The charming harbour village boasts a wonderful selection of cafés, restaurants, and local eateries, while families will appreciate the nearby amusement park, crazy golf, and ten-pin bowling, ensuring entertainment for all ages. Conveniently located less than an hour from Dublin, 7 Glencove offers the perfect opportunity to enjoy relaxed coastal living without compromising on accessibility.\n\n."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGround Floor - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - 3.9m x 1.8m\nat widest point, tiled flooring.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 3.9m x 6.4m\nat widest point, tiled flooring and fitted kitchen units.\n\nLiving Room - 4.7m x 8.3m\nat widest point, laminate wood flooring and feature bay window.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 3.9m x 4.1m\nat widest point, carpet flooring.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 4.6m x 3.0m\ncarpet flooring, built-in wardrobe and sliding door to balcony.\n\nEnsuite - 3.0m x 0.9m\ntiled floor and walls, shower, w.c. and wash hand basin.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.6m x 3.9m\nat widest point, carpet floor and built-in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.4m x 3.1m\nat widest point, carpet flooring and built-in wardrobe.\n\nBathroom - 2.7m x 1.9m\nat widest point, tiled floor and walls, shower, w.c., and wash hand basin\n\n"
